uncer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini said</h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c305644972=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c305644972="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c861632216="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c861632216="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c861632216="" _nghost-ng-c1987417986="" id="message-content-id-r_d4a063082fbbf960" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1987417986="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_d4a063082fbbf960" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0">That looks spot on!</p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1">The yellow banner confirming <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="29"><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="29">security-tool had recent pushes</code></b> means GitHub successfully received everything you pushed from your terminal.</p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2">Right now, you are looking at the <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="34">main</code> branch view (which is why you only see <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="78">LICENSE</code> and <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="90">README.md</code>). To inspect your code and testing screenshot on GitHub:</p><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,0,0">Click the <b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="10"><code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="10">main</code></b> branch dropdown menu on the left side (right above the file list).</p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,1,0">Select <b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="7"><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="7">security-tool</code></b> from the list.
<i data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="36">Verification:</i> The file list will update to show <code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="84">security_tool.py</code> and <code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="105">task1_output.png</code>, and your <code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="132">README.md</code> preview will render your student banner and testing screenshot image perfectly.</p></li></ol><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4">Since Task 1 is completely finished and safely stored on GitHub, you are ready to jump into <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="92">Task 2</b> (<code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="100">security-event-logger</code>).</p><div class="attachment-container unknown md-has-block-component"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><elicitations class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><!----></elicitations><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><election-info-disclaim