s-prompt-bubble enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-luminous-edit-box-updates enable-rich-query-formatting" _nghost-ng-c3142143690="" style="--max-lines-for-collapse-count: 4;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="user-query-container"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="file-preview-container"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="query-content ng-star-inserted" id="user-query-content-11" jslog="275422;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ucQahgKEwjX8_vO2oSYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQnA8"><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="query-bubble-anchor ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="user-query-bubble-with-background luminous-collapsed ng-star-inserted" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl81MDg3MWZjM2IxZWM0YjczIiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="horizontal-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="query-text gds-body-l collapsed" dir="ltr"><h5 _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-user-query-label"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="">You said</span> Task 04: Security Event Logger
A security event logger is a program or system that records security-… <!----></h5><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Task 04: Security Event Logger <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> A security event logger is a program or system that records security-related&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> activities so they can be reviewed later. Security event logs can help organisations&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> to monitor login activity, detect suspicious or repeated failed logins, investigate&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> security incidents, keep a record of system activity and determine when an event&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> occurred.&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> For example, if someone tries to log in with the wrong password, the logger might&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> record: <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Event ID: 3971 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Username: admin <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> IP Address: 192.168.1.25 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Event: Failed login <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Timestamp: 2026-09-27 01:35:42 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Write a program that will ask for a username and password from a user until the&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> user enters the correct username and password. Print the event log for each try, <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> including all failed and successful login attempts.&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Sample Output: <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> SECURITY EVENT LOG <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> ================== <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Event ID: 4532 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Username: admin <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> IP Address: 192.168.1.25 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Event: Failed login <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Timestamp: 2026-09-27 01:30:45 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Event ID: 8232 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Username: admin <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> IP Address: 10.0.0.15 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Event: Successful login <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Timestamp: 2026-09-27 01:32:12 <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Hints: You can use the following Python functions:&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> To get the event ID: <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> Use Python's random module to generate a 4-digit event ID. <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> import random <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> event_id = random.randint(1000, 9999) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> print("Event ID:", event_id) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> To get the timestamp:&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> from datetime import datetime <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> timestamp = datetime.now().strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S") <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> print("Timestamp:", timestamp) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S") is used to format a date and time into a&nbsp; <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> readable string. <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> To get the IP address of your system: <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> import socket <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> s = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_DGRAM) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> s.connect(("8.8.8.8", 80)) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> ip_address = s.getsockname()[0] <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> print("IP Address:", ip_address) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> s.close() ill send u my code one sec <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="luminous-toggle-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" class="luminous-expand-fade ng-star-inserted"></div><button _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" mat-icon-button="" theme="lm" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" gemtooltip="Expand text" data-test-id="luminous-expand-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger luminous-toggle-button mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl81MDg3MWZjM2IxZWM0YjczIiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-424" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><div _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" data-test-id="luminous-expand-pill" class="luminous-toggle-pill"><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" fonticonname="expand_more" size="medium" _nghost-ng-c4096424917=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4096424917="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-m lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more" data-mat-icon-namesp