P address of the user <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; s=socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_DGRAM) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #connect to a public DNS server to determine the local IP address <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; s.connect(("8.8.8.8", 80)) <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #get the local IP address of the user <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ip_address=s.getsockname()[0] <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #close the socket connection <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; s.close() <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #if there is an exception while getting the IP address, set it to a default value <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; except Exception: <!----><!----></p><!-