inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; if is_success: <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #if the login attempt was successful, print a message indicating that access has been granted and break out of the loop to end the program <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; print("access granted. session started.") <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #print a message indicating that access has been granted <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; break <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #break out of the loop to end the program if the login attempt was successful <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; else: <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" dir="auto" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; #if the login attempt was unsuccessful, print a message indicating that access has been denied and continue the loop to prompt the user for login credentials again <!----><!----></p><!----><!----><!----><p _ngcontent-ng-c3142143690="" 