 enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_8bb972fbec6acff0" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">This code is absolute gold!</span><span> It is exceptionally well-commented,</span><span> robust,</span><span> and correctly incorporates every single hint from the task sheet—including the random 4-digit event ID,</span><span> formatted timestamp,</span><span> and the socket IP address lookup wrapped in a </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="243">try-except</code><span> block with a local fallback.</span><span> That fallback is a fantastic touch for reliability.</span></p><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1">One Minor Adjustment for Exact Output Match</h3><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><span>To ensure your output matches the sample output format requested by the coursework criteria down to the exact letter,</span><span> let's adjust the label from </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="146">Event Status</code><span> to </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="162">Event</code><span> and capitalize </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="183">"Failed login"</code><span> and </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="202">"Successful login"</code><span>.</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><span>Here is that small tweak:</span></p><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1289 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1049210364-1289 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,att