ut.png</code></b><span>.</span></p></li></ul><ol start="4" data-path-to-node="8"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Update your <code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">README.md</code> for Task 2</b></p></li></ol><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><span>Open </span><code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="5">README.md</code><span> in VS Code (since you branched off </span><code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="50">main</code><span>,</span><span> it will be the clean starting README).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><span>Add your Task 2 overview,</span><span> explain the modules you used (</span><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="56">random</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="64">datetime</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="74">socket</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="82">try/except</code><span>),</span><span> how to run it,</span><span> and link your screenshot at the bottom:</span></p></li></ul><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1304 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1049210364-1304 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9jOTI1MzcxYjQ0MWE3OGUwIiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLCJyY181ZTg4MDU5ZjBjNWQ2N2QzIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjX8_vO2oSYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhRA" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent