 class="hljs-section"># Name: Haseeb Amir Rasool | Campus: New College Lanarkshire | ID: B01887873</span>

<span class="hljs-section">## Program Overview</span>
For Task 2, I developed a <span class="hljs-strong">**Security Event Logger**</span> in Python. The program continuously prompts the user for login credentials until the correct username (<span class="hljs-code">`admin`</span>) and password are provided. For every login attempt—whether failed or successful—it generates a secure event log containing a randomized 4-digit Event ID, the entered username, the system IP address, the login status, and an exact timestamp.

<span class="hljs-section">## Code Logic &amp; Features Used</span>
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Modules Imported:**</span> 
<span class="hljs-bullet">  *</span> <span class="hljs-code">`random`</span>: Used <span class="hljs-code">`random.randint(1000, 9999)`</span> to generate a unique 4-digit Event ID for each login attempt.
<span class="hljs-bullet">  *</span> <span class="hljs-code">`datetime`</span>: Used <span class="hljs-code">`datetime.now().strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")`</span> to capture and format the timestamp of when the event occurred.
<span class="hljs-bullet">  *</span> <span class="hljs-code">`socket`</span>: Used a socket connection to query a public DNS server (<span class="hljs-code">`8.8.8.8`</span>) to retrieve the local system's IP address.
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Error Handling (`try-except`):**</span> Wrapped the socket IP lookup in a <span class="hljs-code">`try-except`</span> block so that if network resolution fails, it gracefully falls back to <span class="hljs-code">`127.0.0.1`</span>.
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Control Flow (`while True` loop &amp; `if/else`):**</span> Keeps the logging loop running continuously on incorrect attempts, and terminates with a success message when correct credentials are matched.

<span class="hljs-section">## How to Run</span>
<span class="hljs-bullet">1.</span> Open your terminal in the repository folder.
<span class="hljs-bullet">2.</span> Make sure you are on the <span class="hljs-code">`security-event-logger`</span> branch.
<span class="hljs-bullet">3.</span> Run the script using the command:
<span class="hljs-code">```bash
py security_event_logger.py
</span></code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h2 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3" class="">Terminal Output Screenshot</h2><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 900ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1316 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1049210364-1316 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9jMWJmMTAzNzRjNzk4NDA1IiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLCJyY18xYWYzZGQ3ODZkNjhiZjVhIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjX8_vO2oSYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQxxA" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1049210364-1316"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1049210364-1316"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1316"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1049210364-1316 no-decoration-radius">
