der,</span><span> let me know,</span><span> and we'll knock out those docstrings for Task 1!</span></p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c3304081241="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c2433247864="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c3895280544="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c757676767="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c757676767-1319 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c1705766050-1321 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1705766050=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1705766050="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1705766050-1321"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1705766050="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1705766050-1321 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c1705766050="" _nghost-ng-c3377908649="" class="ng-tns-c1705766050-1321 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3377908649="" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Good response" gemtooltip="Good response" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surf