ssion;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9kMzcxOTJhYTU4YTk4MzQwIiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLCJyY18zNDJlNWE1ODdjMmY0MTI2IixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3040043696="" _nghost-ng-c4096424917=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4096424917="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1324"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1049210364-1324"><span class="hljs-section"># Name: Haseeb Amir Rasool | Campus: New College Lanarkshire | ID: B01887873</span>

<span class="hljs-section">## Program Overview</span>
A Python security event logger that prompts for login credentials until correct. It records every attempt with a random 4-digit Event ID, system IP, login status, and exact timestamp.

<span class="hljs-section">## Code Logic &amp; Features Used</span>
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Random Module:**</span> Generates a unique 4-digit event ID (<span class="hljs-code">`random.randint(1000, 9999)`</span>).
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Datetime Module:**</span> Formats the current timestamp (<span class="hljs-code">`datetime.now().strftime(...)`</span>).
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Socket Module:**</span> Retrieves the local system IP address with a <span class="hljs-code">`try-except`</span> fallback (<span class="hljs-code">`127.0.0.1`</span>).
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Control Flow:**</span> Uses a <span class="hljs-code">`while True`</span> loop to keep logging failed attempts until valid credentials (<span class="hljs-code">`admin`</span> / <span class="hljs-code">`Password123!`</span>) are entered.

<span class="hljs-section">## How to Run</span>
Open your terminal in the repository folder on the <span class="hljs-code">`security-event-logger`</span> branch and run:
<span class="hljs-code">```bash
py security_event_logger.py
</span></code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h2 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2">Terminal Output Screenshot</h2><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1325 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1049210364-1325 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9kMzcxOTJhYTU4YTk4MzQwIiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLCJyY18zNDJlNWE1ODdjMmY0MTI2IixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjX8_vO2oSYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhhE" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1049210364-1325"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1049210364-1325"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1325"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1049210364-1325 no-decoration-radius">
