><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1333"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1049210364-1333"><span class="hljs-section"># Name: Haseeb Amir Rasool | Campus: New College Lanarkshire | ID: B01887873</span>

<span class="hljs-section">## Program Overview</span>
for task 2 i made a security event logger in python that continuously asks the user to enter a username and password until they get it right. for every single try—whether it fails or succeeds—the program generates and prints out a detailed event log showing a random 4-digit event ID, the entered username, the system IP address, the event status (failed or successful login), and an exact timestamp.

<span class="hljs-section">## Code Logic &amp; Features Used</span>
i used several built-in python libraries and control flow structures. i imported the random module and used random.randint(1000, 9999) as a function to generate a unique 4-digit event ID for every attempt. i imported the datetime module and used datetime.now().strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S") as a formatting function to capture the current date and time into a readable string. i imported the socket module to create a socket connection function that queries a public address to fetch the local system's ip address, and i wrapped it in a try-except error handling block so that if there is a network error it safely falls back to 127.0.0.1. for control flow, i used a while true loop to keep the login prompt running continuously on incorrect attempts, and an if/else statement to check credentials, update the event status, and break out of the loop with a success message when correct login details are provided.

<span class="hljs-section">## How to Run</span>
open in your terminal in the repository folder. make sure you are on the security-event-logger branch. run the script using "bash"
python security<span class="hljs-emphasis">_event_</span>logger.py

<span class="hljs-section">## Terminal Output Screenshot</span>
![<span class="hljs-string">Task 2 Output</span>](<span class="hljs-link">task2_output.png</span>)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><span>Just copy that right into your </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="31">README.md</code><span>,</span><span> save it,</span><span> and once you have your </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="74">task2_output.png</code><span> screenshot saved in your folder,</span><span> let me know and we can move on to docstrings or whatever is next!</span></p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c3304081241="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c2433247864="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _ngho