4972=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c305644972="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c861632216="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c861632216="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c861632216="" _nghost-ng-c1987417986="" id="message-content-id-r_de9d6c3303578566" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1987417986="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_de9d6c3303578566" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">Ah,</span><span> that happens when paragraphs are written as one giant long line in Markdown without line breaks!</span><span> It forces you to scroll horizontally.</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><span>Let's fix that by breaking those long lines down into wrapped paragraphs.</span><span> It will look much cleaner,</span><span> fit right on your screen without any side-scrolling,</span><span> and still keep that exact same natural student vibe.</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><span>Drop this into your </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="20" class="">README.md</code><span>:</span></p><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1337 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1049210364-1337 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9kZTlkNmMzMzAzNTc4NTY2IiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLCJyY182ZGY2OTI0OTkzY2NiNjRlIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjX8_vO2oSYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ-BE" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1049210364-1337"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1049210364-1337"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c1049210364-1337 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1337">Markdown</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1049210364-1337 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1049210364-1337 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3040043696="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-410" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3040043696="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3040043696="" _nghost-ng-c4096424917=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4096424917="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copy code" gemtooltip="Copy code" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1049210364-1337 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3040043696="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-411" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3040043696="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9kZTlkNmMzMzAzNTc4NTY2IiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLCJyY182ZGY2OTI0OTkzY2NiNjRlIixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3040043696="" _nghost-ng-c4096424917=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4096424917="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1337"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1049210364-1337"><span class="hljs-section"># Name: Haseeb Amir Rasool | Campus: New College Lanarkshire | ID: B01887873</span>

<span class="hljs-section">## Program Overview</span>

for task 2 i made a security event logger in python that continuously asks the user to enter a username and password until they get it right. for every single try—whether it fails or succeeds—the program generates and prints out a detailed event log showing a random 4-digit event ID, the entered username, the system IP address, the event status (failed or successful login), and an exact timestamp.

<span class="hljs-section">## Code Logic &amp; Features Used</span>

i used several built-in python libraries and control flow structures. 

i imported the <span class="hljs-strong">**random**</span> module and used the <span class="hljs-code">`random.randint(1000, 9999)`</span> function to generate a unique 4-digit event ID for every attempt. 

i imported the <span class="hljs-strong">**datetime**</span> module and used the <span class="hljs-code">`datetime.now().strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")`</span> formatting function to capture the current date and time into a readable string. 

i imported the <span class="hljs-strong">**socket**</span> module to create a connection function that queries a public address to fetch the local system's ip address, and i wrapped it in a <span class="hljs-strong">**try-except**</span> error handling block so that if there is a network error it safely falls back to <span class="hljs-code">`127.0.0.1`</span>. 

for control flow, i used a <span class="hljs-code">`while true`</span> loop to keep the login prompt running continuously on incorrect attempts, and an <span class="hljs-code">`if/else`</span> statement to check credentials, update the event status, and break out of the loop with a success message when correct login details are provided.

<span class="hljs-section">## How to Run</span>

open in your terminal in the repository folder. make sure you are on the security-event-logger branch. run the script using "bash"
python security<span class="hljs-emphasis">_event_</span>logger.py

<span class="hljs-section">## Terminal Output Screenshot</span>

