de" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1049210364-1341 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3040043696="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-411" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3040043696="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl82ZjQyZjk2NmI2MDQ0YjY2IiwiY182NGE3ZWY5ZDBhNzI3Y2M0IixudWxsLCJyY18zNDgxYmZlNzgxNjYyMTU5IixudWxsLG51bGwsImVuIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3040043696="" _nghost-ng-c4096424917=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4096424917="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1341"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1049210364-1341"><span class="hljs-section"># Name: Haseeb Amir Rasool | Campus: New College Lanarkshire | ID: B01887873</span>

<span class="hljs-section">## Program Overview</span>

for task 2 i built a security event logger in python that continuously prompts the user to enter a username and password until they provide the correct credentials. for every login attempt—whether it fails or succeeds—the program generates a detailed log showing a random 4-digit event ID, the username entered, the system IP address, the event status, and an exact timestamp.

<span class="hljs-section">## Code Logic &amp; Features Used</span>

i used several built-in python modules and control structures to make this work:

<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Random Module:**</span> i used the <span class="hljs-code">`random.randint(1000, 9999)`</span> function to automatically generate a unique 4-digit event ID for every try.
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Datetime Module:**</span> i used the <span class="hljs-code">`datetime.now().strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")`</span> formatting function to capture the current date and time into a readable string.
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Socket Module &amp; Error Handling:**</span> i used the socket library to create a connection function that looks up the local system's ip address, and i wrapped it in a <span class="hljs-code">`try-except`</span> block so that if any network issues happen, it safely falls back to <span class="hljs-code">`127.0.0.1`</span>.
<span class="hljs-bullet">*</span> <span class="hljs-strong">**Control Flow:**</span> i used a <span class="hljs-code">`while true`</span> loop to keep the login prompt running continuously until valid credentials (<span class="hljs-code">`admin`</span> and password) are entered, using <span class="hljs-code">`if/else`</span> statements to log success or failure.

<span class="hljs-section">## How to Run</span>

open in your terminal in the repository folder. make sure you are on the security-event-logger branch. run the script using:
python security<span class="hljs-emphasis">_event_</span>logger.py

