-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" class="ng-tns-c1049210364-1353"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1049210364="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1049210364-1353">py security_event_logger.py
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Test a Failed Login (First Attempt):</b></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,2,1"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,2,1,0,0"><span>When it prompts for a username,</span><span> type something wrong (e.</span><span>g.,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="60">wronguser</code><span>).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,2,1,1,0"><span>When it prompts for a password,</span><span> type something wrong (e.</span><span>g.,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="60">wrongpass</code><span>).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,2,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">What to check:</b><span> The terminal should output a 4-digit Event ID,</span><span> your username,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="77">Event: Failed login</code><span>,</span><span> your local IP address,</span><span> the correct timestamp,</span><span> and the message </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="160">access denied. please try again</code><span>.</span><span> Because it's a </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="208">while True</code><span> loop,</span><span> it should then immediately prompt you to try logging in again.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Test a Successful Login (Second Attempt):</b></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,3,1"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,3,1,0,0"><span>When it prompts for the username again,</span><span> type the correct admin username:</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,3,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="73">admin</code></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,3,1,1,0"><span>When it prompts for the password,</span><span> type the correct password:</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,3,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="61">Password123!</code></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,3,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,3,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">What to check:</b><span> The terminal should output a </span><i data-path-to-node="2,3,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="44">new</i><span> random 4-digit Event ID,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,3,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="73">admin</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,3,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="80">Event: Successful login</code><span>,</span><span> the IP address,</span><span> the timestamp,</span><span> print </span><code data-path-to-node="2,3,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="142">access granted. session started.</code><span>,</span><span> and then </span><b data-path-to-node="2,3,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="185">successfully exit/terminate the program</b><span>.</span></p></li></ul></li></ol><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><span>Once you see both the failed log and the successful log print out in succession,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="81">take your screenshot right there</b><span> while both attempts are visible in the terminal!</span><span> Save it as </span><code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="174">task2_output.png</code><span> in your folder.</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4"><span>Let me know once you've captured your screenshot!</span></p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c3304081241="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c2433247864="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" _nghost-ng-c3895280544="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c757676767="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c757676767-1352 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c551107045="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c1705766050-1354 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1705766050=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1705766050="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1705766050-1354"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1705766050="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1705766050-1354 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c1705766050="" _nghost-ng-c3377908649="" class="ng-tns-c1705766050-1354 luminous-theme ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3377908649="" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="Good response" gemtooltip="Good response" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-bu